<title>USA: FGIC says has capacity for NYC Water Finance bonds.</title>
<headline>FGIC says has capacity for NYC Water Finance bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Wednesday it has limited capacity for New York City Municipal Water Finance Authority bonds.</p>
<p>FGIC's secondary market insurance is available on a first-come, first-served basis, the company said.</p>
<p>For more information, call 212-312-3020 or 800-466-FGIC.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
